    {
      "name": "编译与上传",
      "description": "集成 Arduino 编译工具链——通过 arduino-builder 调用 avr-gcc/arm-gcc 等交叉编译器根据板卡配置编译草图，再通过 avrdude/bossac 将编译产物上传到目标板。支持多种板卡与编程器。",
      "evidence": ["arduino-core/src/cc/arduino/Compiler.java", "arduino-core/src/cc/arduino/packages/Uploader.java", "arduino-core/src/cc/arduino/UploaderUtils.java"]
